1.9. "Permitted Donations" means voluntary payments that:

  a. are not required to access, use, queue for, or receive features in a
     Community Server;
  b. do not provide gameplay advantages, virtual items, ranks, priority,
     exclusive access, support entitlements, or other consideration;
  c. are clearly described as voluntary support; and
  d. are not used to disguise a fee, subscription, sale, or Commercial Use.

1.10. "Transparent Cost Sharing" means collecting no more than a reasonable,
good-faith share of actual third-party infrastructure costs, such as VPS,
domain, certificate, bandwidth, or storage expenses, provided that:

  a. participation is not operated for profit;
  b. costs and collections are disclosed to participants on request;
  c. no developer labor, markup, management fee, premium access, or gameplay
     advantage is sold; and
  d. collected amounts are used only for the relevant Community Server's
     infrastructure.

